# Fecund Greenshell triggers only when a creature "enters" (CR 603.6a), not on any other zone change. On turn 1 the Greenshell and Devoted
# Hero (1/2) enter and put two Forests onto the battlefield. On turn 3 Bot1 exiles its own Hero with Swords to Plowshares: the Hero
# leaves the battlefield, which is not an entering, so the top card of the library (Island) is not looked at or moved: it stays on top
# and the hand holds only the Forest drawn for the turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Fecund Greenshell
Devoted Hero
Swords to Plowshares
Forest
Forest
Forest
Island x2
Lightning Bolt
Island x5

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

